cumento en vigor» para viajar gratis no se reconoce igual en todas partes; pregunte en la federación de personas con discapacidad local cuál reconocen."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Mi nota"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Escribe un recordatorio…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/es/tip/33-11"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Anterior"]},"El impuesto sobre la renta de las personas físicas de una persona con discapacidad puede reducirse; cuánto, pregúntelo por teléfono a la administración tributaria provincial"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/es/tip/33-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Siguiente"]},"En la prueba nacional de acceso a la universidad, las personas con discapacidad pueden solicitar ajustes razonables; con examen en braille el tiempo se amplía la mitad"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","